+Discount API repair — DONE. Per README.md (authoritative), `total(prices, rebate_percent=0)` takes a percentage 0-100 inclusive and raises ValueError outside that range. checkout.py now validates the range and computes `subtotal * (1 - rebate_percent / 100)`. The earlier note claiming "the current implementation is correct" was stale: it treated rebate_percent as a fraction, giving e.g. total([100], rebate_percent=10) == -900. Fixed and verified: tests green (4 passed).
